"""Simulations — a Layer-0 project page: every game of the week simulated 10,000 times by a play-by-play Monte Carlo built on the
coordinators' tendencies. v4: eight views — Slate (cards, box scores, key numbers), Players (every man on the slate with his full
fantasy distribution: floor · median · ceiling · boom · bust), Volatility (most volatile / most stable players and games off the
simulated ranges), Props (the sim's probability against every posted player line), Markets (moneyline · spread · total · alt-line
ladders), Run it yourself (any game or any two teams, swap quarterbacks, sit players, lean the play-calling, compare to the pre-run),
Backtest (accuracy and whether the sim's spread of outcomes is right), Method & log.
Inputs: data/processed/sim_params.json, sim_games.json, sim_backtest.json, bet_lines.csv (posted props), scripts/sim_engine.js
Output: dashboard/simulations.html
"""
